  "rules": [
    "R1: In DARK, fixed_spawns alone must cover the whole repair chain without a lockpick (>=3 cable, >=2 fuse, >=2 transistor, >=2 wiring). Suburbs is district 1: nothing can be imported, so cable->PARTIAL, fuse->STREETS and transistor->FULL must all be findable here.",
    "R2: Rolled loot never includes stage-gated items early: table lookup uses the CURRENT DistrictData.Stage only.",
    "R3: Fixed spawns are one-time per save; rolls are per-container with container_modifiers on qty.",
    "R4: No firearms or weapon-tier items in suburbs (tutorial threat tier; molotov/firework/noise_bomb are the ceiling).",
    "R5: Coin rolls replace a full shop economy here — suburbs has no trader."
  ]
